      "preview": "בָּזַז: despojar, saquear; tomar como despojo; ser saqueado.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזַז</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: despojar, saquear (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَزّ</span>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܰܙ</span>; amárico በዘበዘ: também etíope ቤዘወ: <em>resgatar</em> Prä<sup>BAS i. 33</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבָזַז</span> (consecutivo) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.19\">Ez 29.19</a>; 3.ª pessoa plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽזֲזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:53\" href=\"/Numbers.31.53\">Nm 31.53</a> + 7 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזָ֑זוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:9\" href=\"/Numbers.31.9\">Nm 31.9</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבְזָזוּם</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.5\">Jr 20.5</a>; 1.ª pessoa plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזַזְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.35\">Dt 2.35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּזּוֹנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.7\">Dt 3.7</a>; imperfeito, 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּבֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.14\">Dt 20.14</a>, plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֹ֫זּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">Is 10.2</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּבֹ֫זּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:27\" href=\"/Genesis.34.27\">Gn 34.27</a> + 4 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבָזּוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.9\">Sf 2.9</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina plural <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּבֹ֫זּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:2\" href=\"/Joshua.8.2\">Js 8.2</a>; 1.ª pessoa plural, coortativo <span dir=\"rtl\">נָבֹ֫זָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.36\">1Sm 14.36</a> (cf. Ges<sup>§ 67 R. 11</sup>); imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּ֫זּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:10\" href=\"/Nahum.2.10\">Na 2.10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">Is 10.6</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:13\" href=\"/Esther.3.13\">Et 3.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:11\" href=\"/Esther.8.11\">Et 8.11</a>; particípio ativo plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּֽזֲזִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.24\">Is 42.24</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2Cr 20.25</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּֽזֲזַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.16\">Jr 30.16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּֽזֲזֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.14\">Is 17.14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּֽזֲזֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.10\">Ez 39.10</a>; passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזוּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">Is 42.22</a>;—<em>despojar</em> = tomar como despojo, com acusativo de coisa <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:9\" href=\"/Numbers.31.9\">Nm 31.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.35\">Dt 2.35</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> e sufixo reflexivo) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.5\">Jr 20.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.12\">Ez 26.12</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:10\" href=\"/Nahum.2.10\">Na 2.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:11\" href=\"/Psalms.109.11\">Sl 109.11</a>; mais frequentemente com acusativo cognato, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:32\" href=\"/Numbers.31.32\">Nm 31.32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">Is 10.6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלַל שָׁלָל</span>, como frequentemente ocorre) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.19\">Ez 29.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.12\">Ez 38.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.13\">Ez 38.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.13\">2Cr 25.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.7\">Dt 3.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.14\">Dt 20.14</a> (ambos seguidos de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> com sufixo reflexivo) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2Cr 20.25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.8\">2Cr 28.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:13\" href=\"/Esther.3.13\">Et 3.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:11\" href=\"/Esther.8.11\">Et 8.11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בהמה</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:2\" href=\"/Joshua.8.2\">Js 8.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:27\" href=\"/Joshua.8.27\">Js 8.27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:14\" href=\"/Joshua.11.14\">Js 11.14</a> (todos seguidos de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> com sufixo reflexivo); objeto: pessoa levada cativa (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בַּז²\" href=\"/BDB,_בַּז²\", dir=\"rtl\">בַּז</a>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:29\" href=\"/Genesis.34.29\">Gn 34.29</a> (texto massorético, mas cf. Ol); <em>saquear, despojar</em>, com acusativo da pessoa saqueada <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">Is 10.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.14\">Is 11.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.14\">Is 17.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שׁסה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">Is 42.22</a> (‖ <em>idem</em>) <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.9\">Sf 2.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.16\">Jr 30.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.10\">Ez 39.10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּהֶם</span> (pessoas) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.36\">1Sm 14.36</a>; com acusativo do lugar saqueado <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:27\" href=\"/Genesis.34.27\">Gn 34.27</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.16\">2Rs 7.16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.13\">2Cr 14.13</a>; uso absoluto <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:53\" href=\"/Numbers.31.53\">Nm 31.53</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.24\">Is 42.24</a>.<br>†<strong>Nifal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָבֹ֫זּוּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:11\" href=\"/Amos.3.11\">Am 3.11</a>; imperfeito, 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבּוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.3\">Is 24.3</a>; infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הִבּוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.3\">Is 24.3</a>—<em>ser despojado, saqueado</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ארמנות</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:11\" href=\"/Amos.3.11\">Am 3.11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.3\">Is 24.3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הִבּוֹז תִּבּוֹז</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִבּוֹק תִּבּוֹק</span>).<br>†<strong>Pual</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבֻזָּ֑ווּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.37\">Jr 50.37</a>—<em>ser tomado como despojo</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אוצרת</span>.",
