      "preview": "בָּחַן: examinar, perscrutar, provar, testar; ser posto à prova.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחַן</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: examinar, provar (</strong>cf. aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַן</span>, siríaco <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܰܚܶܢ</span>, <em>provar, examinar;</em> árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">محن</span> i. viiii. <em>testar</em>, cf. W<sup>SG 65</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחָנַ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 23:10\" href=\"/Job.23.10\">Jó 23.10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחַנְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:3\" href=\"/Psalms.17.3\">Sl 17.3</a> + 7 vezes; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְחָ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:5\" href=\"/Psalms.11.5\">Sl 11.5</a> + 5 vezes; imperativo com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחָנֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:2\" href=\"/Psalms.26.2\">Sl 26.2</a> + 2 vezes; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.9\">Zc 13.9</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּחֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.20\">Jr 11.20</a> + 5 vezes (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צרף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נסה</span>);— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>examinar, perscrutar, provar</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:5\" href=\"/Psalms.11.5\">Sl 11.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:23\" href=\"/Psalms.139.23\">Sl 139.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:18\" href=\"/Job.7.18\">Jó 7.18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַפְעַפָּיו יִבְחֲנוּ בְנֵי אָדָם</span> <em>Suas pálpebras provam os filhos dos homens</em> (perscrutam-nos inteiramente) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:4\" href=\"/Psalms.11.4\">Sl 11.4</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>provar, testar, pôr à prova</em>. <strong>a.</strong>  com a metáfora do ouro <a data-ref=\"Job 23:10\" href=\"/Job.23.10\">Jó 23.10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבְחַנְתִּים כִּבְחֹן אֶת־הַזָּהָב</span> <em>e eu os provarei como se prova o ouro</em> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.9\">Zc 13.9</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  sem metáfora, de Deus provando pessoas <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:2\" href=\"/Psalms.26.2\">Sl 26.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:10\" href=\"/Psalms.66.10\">Sl 66.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:8\" href=\"/Psalms.81.8\">Sl 81.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.6\">Jr 9.6</a>; caminhos <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.27\">Jr 6.27</a> (profeta); o <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:3\" href=\"/Psalms.17.3\">Sl 17.3</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.3\">Jr 12.3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.3\">Pv 17.3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.17\">1Cr 29.17</a>; rins <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.10\">Jr 17.10</a>; coração e rins <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:10\" href=\"/Psalms.7.10\">Sl 7.10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.20\">Jr 11.20</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.12\">Jr 20.12</a>). <strong>c.</strong>  do homem provando ou tentando a Deus <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:9\" href=\"/Psalms.95.9\">Sl 95.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:10\" href=\"/Malachi.3.10\">Ml 3.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:15\" href=\"/Malachi.3.15\">Ml 3.15</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  o ouvido provando palavras <a data-ref=\"Job 12:11\" href=\"/Job.12.11\">Jó 12.11</a> = <a data-ref=\"Job 34:3\" href=\"/Job.34.3\">Jó 34.3</a>.<br><strong>Nifal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבָּחֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:36\" href=\"/Job.34.36\">Jó 34.36</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:15\" href=\"/Genesis.42.15\">Gn 42.15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:16\" href=\"/Genesis.42.16\">Gn 42.16</a>, <em>ser provado, posto à prova</em>.<br><strong>Pual</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּחַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.18\">Ez 21.18</a> <em>a prova foi feita</em> (𝔊 𝔖 𝔙 Ges MV Ew Ke, mas substantivo <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּ֫חַן</span> texto massorético, Symm Haev; leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחֵן</span> <em>com graça, favor</em>, Hi Co).",
