      "preview": "מִבְטָח: ato, objeto e estado de confiança; segurança.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטָח</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>] confiança <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.16\">Ez 29.16</a>—construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.26\">Pv 14.26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטָח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:6\" href=\"/Psalms.65.6\">Sl 65.6</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטַחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:24\" href=\"/Job.31.24\">Jó 31.24</a> + 6 vezes (dagueche implícito); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטֶחָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.13\">Jr 48.13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטֶחָהֿ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.22\">Pv 21.22</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטַחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.18\">Is 32.18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְטָחַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.37\">Jr 2.37</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>o ato</em> de confiar <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.22\">Pv 21.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.19\">Pv 22.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.19\">Pv 25.19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>o objeto</em> da confiança <a data-ref=\"Job 8:14\" href=\"/Job.8.14\">Jó 8.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 18:14\" href=\"/Job.18.14\">Jó 18.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:24\" href=\"/Job.31.24\">Jó 31.24</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:5\" href=\"/Psalms.40.5\">Sl 40.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:6\" href=\"/Psalms.65.6\">Sl 65.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:5\" href=\"/Psalms.71.5\">Sl 71.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.37\">Jr 2.37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.7\">Jr 17.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.13\">Jr 48.13</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.16\">Ez 29.16</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  o estado de confiança, <em>segurança</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.26\">Pv 14.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.18\">Is 32.18</a>.",
