      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַטִּחִים</span></big>  <strong>substantivo</strong>[<strong>masculino</strong>]<strong>plural: melancias (</strong>hebraico da Mishná <span dir=\"rtl\">אבטיח</span>, samaritano <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠁࠈࠉࠇ</span>; cf. Löw<sup>No. 297</sup>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بِطِّيخٌ</span> etc.; talvez empréstimo no hebraico, cf. Sta<sup>§ 258</sup>; egípcio moderno <em>baṭṭich, biṭṭich</em> cf. referências em Di <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:5\" href=\"/Numbers.11.5\">Nm 11.5</a>; sobre a formação, cf. Lag<sup>BN 10</sup>, que compara o etíope <em>aqṭala</em><strong>)</strong>—fruto egípcio, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:5\" href=\"/Numbers.11.5\">Nm 11.5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִקִּשֻּׁאִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶֽחָצִיר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבְּצָלִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשּׁוּמִים</span>); 𝔊 τοὺς πέπονας.",
