      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּינָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: entendimento</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.32\">1Cr 12.32</a> + 28 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּינַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.2\">Pv 30.2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.14\">Is 29.14</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּינָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:3\" href=\"/Job.20.3\">Jó 20.3</a> + 4 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּינוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.11\">Is 27.11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>o ato</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.19\">Is 33.19</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.20\">Jr 23.20</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:20\" href=\"/Daniel.1.20\">Dn 1.20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:15\" href=\"/Daniel.8.15\">Dn 8.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:22\" href=\"/Daniel.9.22\">Dn 9.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:1\" href=\"/Daniel.10.1\">Dn 10.1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>a faculdade</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:3\" href=\"/Job.20.3\">Jó 20.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 39:26\" href=\"/Job.39.26\">Jó 39.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.5\">Pv 3.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.4\">Pv 23.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.2\">Pv 30.2</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.11\">Is 27.11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קנה בינה</span> <em>adquirir entendimento</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.5\">Pv 4.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.7\">Pv 4.7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.16\">Pv 16.16</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>o objeto</em> do conhecimento <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.6\">Dt 4.6</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.12\">1Cr 22.12</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 28:12\" href=\"/Job.28.12\">Jó 28.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 28:20\" href=\"/Job.28.20\">Jó 28.20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 28:28\" href=\"/Job.28.28\">Jó 28.28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:16\" href=\"/Job.34.16\">Jó 34.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:36\" href=\"/Job.38.36\">Jó 38.36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 39:17\" href=\"/Job.39.17\">Jó 39.17</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.6\">Pv 9.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.10\">Pv 9.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.23\">Pv 23.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.2\">Is 11.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.14\">Is 29.14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדַע בִינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.32\">1Cr 12.32</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.11\">2Cr 2.11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.12\">2Cr 2.12</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:4\" href=\"/Job.38.4\">Jó 38.4</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.2\">Pv 1.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.1\">Pv 4.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.24\">Is 29.24</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  personificado <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.8\">Pv 2.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.4\">Pv 7.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.14\">Pv 8.14</a>.",
