      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חוֹרֹן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar</strong> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">11</a>, também <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ חֹרוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ חֹרֹן</span>, e em Crônicas <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ חוֹרוֹן</span>, duas cidades em Efraim, Bete-Horom inferior e superior <strong>(</strong><em>lugar de um buraco</em> ou <em>de uma cavidade</em>(?) <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹר</span>, talvez de um uádi entre as duas ou nas proximidades; cf. também <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַעֲלֶה\" href=\"/BDB,_מַעֲלֶה\", dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲלֶה</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרַד</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 3:16\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).3.16\">1 Macc 3:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"The Book of Maccabees I (Kahana Translation) 3:24\" href=\"/The_Book_of_Maccabees_I_(Kahana_Translation).3.24\">24</a><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.24\">1 Ch 7:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־בּית־חוֹרוֹן הַתַּחְתּוֹן וְאֶת־הָעֶלְיוֹן</span>; além disso,<br><strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ ח׳ עֶלְיוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 16:5\" href=\"/Joshua.16.5\">Jos 16:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ ח׳ הָעֶלְיוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2 Ch 8:5</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  a uma hora a oeste de <strong>a.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ ח׳ תַּחְתּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 16:3\" href=\"/Joshua.16.3\">Jos 16:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:13\" href=\"/Joshua.18.13\">18:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.17\">1 K 9:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳ ח׳ הַתַּחְתּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.5\">2 Ch 8:5</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:14\" href=\"/Joshua.18.14\">18:14</a>; provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:22\" href=\"/Joshua.21.22\">21:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.18\">1 S 13:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:53\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.53\">1 Ch 6:53</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.13\">2 Ch 25:13</a>;—atuais <em>Beit ʿUbr el-fôqa</em> e <em>et-taḫta</em> Rob<sup>BR ii. 250 f.</sup> Bd<sup>Pal. 21</sup> Survey<sup>iii. 86</sup>;—cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹרֹנִי</span> <strong>adjetivo gentílico</strong> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.10\">Ne 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.28\">13:28</a>, somente de Sambalate; também dual <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֹנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">11</a> 𝔊 & <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.34\">2 S 13:34</a> 𝔊 We Dr.",
